    "title": "Beautiful Mother's Day Gift Ideas from The Stock Market in Shawano - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Fox 11 Living. ,\n1 days ago The Stock Market in Shawano has so many great gift ideas for mom this Mother's Day and Abby joined Fox 11 Living to share some of the pretty things they carry in the store. The Stock Market is a specialty food store that carries olive oils, vinegars, gourmet foods, wine, spirits, craft beers and unique gifts. Be sure to follow them on Facebook for fun upcoming events. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
